@startuml
title Metrorin - Overall System Flow

start

:Open Metrorin Web Application;
:Login;
:Backend Authentication;

if (Valid?) then (No)
    :Login Error;
    stop
else (Yes)
    :Generate JWT;
    :Load Role & Permissions;
    :Access Dashboard;
endif

:Select System Function;

note right
  • Dashboard
    - Overview of network and assets
    - View system status and statistics

  • Map
    - View network infrastructure
    - Locate assets and connections

  • Data Management
    - Manage assets and network data
    - Create / View / Update records
    - Import the excel file

  • Users & Roles
    - Manage system users
    - Manage roles and access

  • System Logs
    - View system activities
    - Track user and system actions

  • Report Generation
    - Generate network reports
    - Export system information

  • System Settings
    - Configure system settings
    - Manage system preferences
end note

:Send API Request;
:Validate JWT & Permissions;

if (Authorized?) then (Yes)
    :Process Request;
    :Read / Write PostgreSQL + PostGIS;
    :Return API Response;
    :Display Result;
else (No)
    :Return 403 Forbidden;
    :Display Access Denied;
endif

if (Logout?) then (Yes)
    :Logout;
    stop
else (No)
    :Return to Dashboard;
endif

@enduml